==Norwegian Nynorsk==

===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|nn|setje}}
* {{nn-inf|sett}}

===Etymology===
{{root|nn|ine-pro|*sed-}}
From {{inh|nn|non|setja}}, from {{inh|nn|gem-pro|*satjaną}}. Akin to {{cog|en|set}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|nn|/²sɛːça/|/²sɛçːa/}}

===Verb===
{{nn-verb-comireg}}

# to [[put]], [[position]]
#: {{usex|nn|Eg '''set''' stolen her.|inline=1|I'll '''put''' the chair here.}}

====Derived terms====
* {{l|nn|omsetja}}
* {{l|nn|setja etter}}

